  "title": "V2X Joins S&P SmallCap 600 Index",
  "summary": "RESTON, Va., July 27, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — V2X, Inc. (NYSE: VVX), a leading provider of global mission solutions supporting national security, defense, and civilian customers, today announced it has joined the S&P SmallCap 600 Index, following S&P Dow Jones Indices’ previously announced rebalancing. “Joining the S&P SmallCap 600 is an important milestone for V2X and […]",
